        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8254, Grade 1 Low Profile Squared Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>The Baldwin Squared Deadbolt is a beautiful example of old and new. It is available in Venetian Bronze, Distressed Oil Rubbed Bronze, Distressed Antique Nickel as well as many other finishes. This combination of contemporary shapes and traditional finishes allows the Squared Single Cylinder Deadbolt to revamp out-dated decor. This door lock will fit 2-1/8\" door hole preparations on 1-3/4\" thick doors and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou'll find the quality, peace of mind and beauty you expect from Baldwin in every lock. A heavy gauge steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts gives this ANSI Grade 1, the highest level security, door lock both strength and durability that is backed by a lifetime limited mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a thumbturn from the interior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Single_cylinder.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"307\" height=\"141\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Single Cylinder Diagram\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-squared-grade-1-deadbolt-baldwin-8255\"><b>Squared Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8254 Squared Single Cylinder Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1:  Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" diameter door cutouts</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2.75\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Squared Grade 1 Deadbolt, Baldwin 8254",
                "description": "Baldwin 8254 Single Cylinder Squared Deadbolt - This Baldwin Squared Deadbolt is a beautiful example of old and new. It is available in Venetian Bronze, Distressed Oil Rubbed Bronze, Distressed Antique Nickel and many other finishes, all of which give the otherwise modern square rose an old world appearance. This combination of contemporary shapes and traditional finishes allows the Squared Single Cylinder Deadbolt to revamp out-dated decor. This door lock will fit 2-1/8 inch door hole preparations on 1-3/4 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-8254, Baldwin 8254, baldwin Squared deadbolts, baldwin single cylinder deadbolts, grade 1 deadbolts, steel deadbolts, Squared door locks, baldwin door locks, baldwin images collections, square deadbolts,"
